Build an AI image-to-video mobile app called “AI Mehboob”.

The app should have a clean, modern and easy-to-use interface. Users can upload an image from their phone or computer, enter a text prompt describing the video they want, choose a video duration from 5 seconds, 10 seconds, 30 seconds, 1 minute, 3 minutes, or 5 minutes, and tap a “Generate Video” button.

Include:
- Image upload and preview
- Text prompt box
- Video duration selector
- Generate Video button
- Loading/progress screen while the video is being generated
- Video preview player
- Download Video button
- Share Video button
- My Videos/history section
- Delete video option
- Simple user profile/settings page

Use a premium black and gold visual style. Make the app responsive for mobile and desktop. Give the app the name “AI Mehboob” and make the interface simple enough for beginners.

Prepare the app structure so an AI image-to-video generation API can be connected later. Use clean navigation and clearly labeled buttons.